STEP 5 -- WITHDRAWAL, PROVEN ON THE WIRE -- AND THE TIGHTEST CONTROL AVAILABLE ON THIS BENCH.

  ONE prefix is withdrawn, and the OTHER prefix from **the same neighbour, over the same link,
  out of the same port** is left advertised.  So a difference between them cannot be a link,
  port, neighbour, instrument or bench effect -- only the advertisement differs.

  5a. WITHDRAW (swi_b, 09:20:47 UTC = 22:20:47 NZDT):
