    x960-28YSQ(config-router)# no network 192.168.70.0/24
  (swi_b's `lo` still carries 192.168.70.1/24 and still has it as a connected route; only the
   RIP advertisement is removed.)

  5b. 🔎 RIP POISONS, IT DOES NOT MERELY TIME OUT.  Polled every 15 s, reading BOTH the route
  table and the RIP database (which is where the mechanism is visible):
